# 🎨 PNG Specification — Cross‑Altitude Bridge Color Tile v1.2 (High‑Fidelity Edition)

1. Canvas
- Dimensions: 2160 × 2880 px (4:5 aspect ratio, high‑resolution)  
- Format: PNG  
- Color Profile: sRGB IEC61966‑2.1  
- Bit Depth: 16‑bit color  
- Transparency: Enabled (full alpha channel)  
- Rendering Intent: Perceptual  
- DPI: 300 (print‑ready)

---

2. Global Style Rules (v1.2 High‑Fidelity Upgrade)

Typography
- Primary Font: Inter Variable (optical sizing enabled)  
- Secondary Font: JetBrains Mono (for equations)  
- Kerning: Optical  
- Leading: 1.15× font size  
- Anti‑aliasing: Subpixel (ClearType‑style)  
- Text Rendering: Geometric precision (no hinting drift)

Iconography
- Vector Source: NDH visual grammar SVG set  
- Stroke Width: 4 px uniform  
- Shadow: 12 px soft ambient occlusion  
- Glow: 8 px Gaussian, 30% opacity

Color Calibration
- Gradient Banding: Dithered  
- Gamma: 2.2  
- Contrast Ratio: Minimum 7:1 for text  
- Chromatic Aberration: Disabled  
- Bloom: 5% (Holonomy tier only)

---

